Prot pally rework: AS on a 6s cooldown, Judgement/HotR both roll a free shield.
Touches: modules/mod-living-gear/src/LivingGear_ClassPerks.cpp
         (PALADIN_AS_PROC_CHANCE, TryPaladinProtJudgementProc,
          TryPaladinProtOnCast)

Why: report #132 -- "rework prot pally, need to do 1 [Avenger's Shield] that
bounces a bunch of times and has a 6s cooldown and judgements and [Hammer of
the Righteous] 50% chance to cast aveng shield".

Three pieces, all building on the #81 bounce machinery that already exists:
- PALADIN_AS_PROC_CHANCE 15 -> 50.
- TryPaladinProtJudgementProc (the #81 proc site) now also matches Hammer of
  the Righteous (53595 chain), so both buttons roll the same 50%.
- The hand-cast shield's own 30s category cooldown is cleared after the cast
  (same deferred-clear pattern as every no-cooldown perk) and a flat 6s is
  applied in the same deferred tick via AddSpellCooldown -- the engine's 30s
  entry lands first, so the replacement actually sticks. The bounce chain
  (30 hops, 10y) is untouched: "bounces a bunch of times" already shipped.

Procs stay on the cast hook (real button pressed, reentry-guarded), so a
chained shield cannot recursively proc another chain.